{"seq":2,"slug":"writeoff-approval-control","title":"核销审批与权限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/suspense-writeoff/writeoff-approval-control","wordCount":1823,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"核销审批与权限\">核销审批与权限</h1><p>核销是把钱从&quot;待查&quot;变成&quot;已消化&quot;的那一刻。这个动作一旦被滥用，它就成了一个洗账通道：任何查不清、追不回、懒得查的差异都可以被核销掉，账面看起来干净，实际上损失被悄悄吸收进损益。核销审批要防的不是&quot;员工偷钱&quot;这种显性舞弊，而是更常见的两件事——<strong>核销理由不成立却无人质疑</strong>，以及<strong>建单和核销是同一个人</strong>导致没有第二双眼睛。前者靠证据与原因码的结构化来防，后者靠职责分离来防，两者都必须在系统层面强制，而不是靠制度文件里的规定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-核销是权力-权力要分档\">核心概念：核销是权力，权力要分档</h2><p>核销权限的设计遵循一个简单原则：<strong>金额越大，需要同意的人越多、层级越高</strong>。这不是官僚主义，而是因为大额核销的犯错成本与复核成本高度不对称——复核一张 50 万美元的核销用掉一位主管 10 分钟，而错误核销的后果可能是一整个季度的利润。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;工单结论 finding&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;拟处置动作&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;writeoff&quot;| C{&quot;金额档位&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;recover_from_channel&quot;| D[&quot;转应收追偿&lt;br/&gt;不进核销审批&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;reclassify&quot;| E[&quot;重分类&lt;br/&gt;不动损益&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;&lt; 50 USD&quot;| F[&quot;自动核销&lt;br/&gt;容差规则&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;50 - 5k&quot;| G[&quot;单人审批&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;5k - 50k&quot;| H[&quot;双人审批&lt;br/&gt;其中一人为主管&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;&gt; 50k&quot;| I[&quot;财务负责人 + 内控&lt;br/&gt;双签&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; J[&quot;写核销记录 + 原因码&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; J&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[\"工单结论 finding\"] --&gt; B{\"拟处置动作\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"writeoff\"| C{\"金额档位\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"recover_from_channel\"| D[\"转应收追偿&lt;br/&gt;不进核销审批\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"reclassify\"| E[\"重分类&lt;br/&gt;不动损益\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"&lt; 50 USD\"| F[\"自动核销&lt;br/&gt;容差规则\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"50 - 5k\"| G[\"单人审批\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"5k - 50k\"| H[\"双人审批&lt;br/&gt;其中一人为主管\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"&gt; 50k\"| I[\"财务负责人 + 内控&lt;br/&gt;双签\"]\n  F --&gt; J[\"写核销记录 + 原因码\"]\n  G --&gt; J\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J</pre><p>最关键的一条是职责分离：授权、保管、记录、核对这四类职能不应由同一个人承担（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Separation_of_duties\">Separation of duties</a>）。映射到本系统：<strong>建单人（记录）不能同时是审批人（授权）</strong>，且<strong>挂账执行者（保管）不能同时是账龄复核者（核对）</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审批矩阵的数据化\">审批矩阵的数据化</h2><h3 id=\"矩阵的维度与形态\">矩阵的维度与形态</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>金额档位（本币折算）</th>\n<th>所需审批人数</th>\n<th>最低层级</th>\n<th>附加条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>≤ 容差阈值</td>\n<td>0（自动）</td>\n<td>系统</td>\n<td>必须命中容差规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>≤ 5,000</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>处理人以上的同级</td>\n<td>结论必须引用证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>≤ 50,000</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>至少 1 名主管</td>\n<td>两人来自不同组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>≤ 500,000</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>财务负责人</td>\n<td>需附带根因说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 500,000</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>财务负责人 + 内控</td>\n<td>需财务负责人书面说明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>矩阵里的门槛值与币种无关地写在&quot;本币折算&quot;上，这带来了一个必须显式处理的细节：<strong>折算用哪一天的汇率</strong>。用核销日汇率、结账日汇率还是差异发生日汇率，会得出不同的档位结论。正确做法是固定一个口径并写进规范——通常用差异发生日（<code>value_date</code>）的记账汇率，因为这才反映&quot;当时这笔差异有多大&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"权限模型\">权限模型</h3><p>权限不要写成&quot;人员 → 金额上限&quot;的直接映射，而要走角色：用户通过角色获得权限，而不是直接获得权限，角色之间可以有继承关系（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Role-based_access_control\">Role-based access control</a>）。这样人员变动时只需改角色分配。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE rbac_role (&#10;  role_code   TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  max_amount_minor BIGINT,&#10;  currencies  TEXT[],&#10;  diff_types  TEXT[]&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE rbac_assignment (&#10;  user_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  role_code    TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES rbac_role(role_code),&#10;  granted_from DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  granted_to   DATE,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (user_id, role_code, granted_from)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE writeoff_decision (&#10;  decision_id  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  case_id      BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  amount_minor BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  currency     CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  reason_code  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  required_approvals SMALLINT NOT NULL,&#10;  approvals_received SMALLINT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  state        TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;pending&#39;&#10;                 CHECK (state IN (&#39;pending&#39;,&#39;approved&#39;,&#39;rejected&#39;,&#39;reopened&#39;)),&#10;  created_by   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE writeoff_approval (&#10;  approval_id  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  decision_id  BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES writeoff_decision(decision_id),&#10;  approver_id  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  action       TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (action IN (&#39;approve&#39;,&#39;reject&#39;)),&#10;  comment      TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (length(comment) &gt;= 5),&#10;  decided_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  UNIQUE (decision_id, approver_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rbac_role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  role_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_amount_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currencies  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  diff_types  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rbac_assignment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  user_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  role_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rbac_role(role_code),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  granted_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  granted_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (user_id, role_code, granted_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> writeoff_decision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_code  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  required_approvals </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  approvals_received </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rejected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reopened'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_by   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> writeoff_approval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  approval_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> writeoff_decision(decision_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  approver_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approve'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reject'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  comment      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(comment) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (decision_id, approver_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个约束值得逐一说明。<code>UNIQUE (decision_id, approver_id)</code> 保证同一人不能在同一决策上投两次票——没有它，&quot;双人审批&quot;可以通过同一个人点两次来满足。<code>comment</code> 的长度约束保证了&quot;拒绝&quot;或&quot;同意&quot;都必须带理由，这让审批记录在事后复盘时有用。<code>required_approvals</code> 是<strong>在创建决策时根据矩阵算出来并冻结</strong>的，而不是在每次审批时重新计算——否则矩阵变更会让进行中的决策改变要求，产生无法解释的状态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"职责分离的强制检查\">职责分离的强制检查</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION check_sod(p_decision BIGINT, p_approver TEXT)&#10;RETURNS void LANGUAGE plpgsql AS $$&#10;DECLARE v_creator TEXT; v_case BIGINT; v_assignee TEXT;&#10;BEGIN&#10;  SELECT created_by, case_id INTO v_creator, v_case&#10;    FROM writeoff_decision WHERE decision_id = p_decision;&#10;&#10;  IF v_creator = p_approver THEN&#10;    RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;SOD violation: creator % cannot approve own decision&#39;, p_approver;&#10;  END IF;&#10;&#10;  SELECT assigned_to INTO v_assignee FROM recon_case WHERE case_id = v_case;&#10;  IF v_assignee = p_approver AND v_creator = v_assignee THEN&#10;    RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;SOD violation: investigator must not be sole approver chain&#39;;&#10;  END IF;&#10;END $$;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_sod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_approver </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> void </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plpgsql </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECLARE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_creator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; v_case </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; v_assignee </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_by, case_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_creator, v_case</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> writeoff_decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decision_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_decision;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_creator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_approver </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RAISE EXCEPTION </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SOD violation: creator % cannot approve own decision'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_approver;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> assigned_to </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_assignee </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recon_case </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_case;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_assignee </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_approver </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_creator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_assignee </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RAISE EXCEPTION </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SOD violation: investigator must not be sole approver chain'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第二段检查是本系统特有的：<strong>调查人（在工单上做过 finding 的人）在单级审批场景下不能成为审批人</strong>。理由很直接——调查人已经形成了结论，让他自己批准自己的结论，等于取消了复核。在多级审批场景下调查人可以作为其中一票，但必须还有另一票来自独立的人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核销原因码的治理\">核销原因码的治理</h2><h3 id=\"原因码要有层级而不是扁平枚举\">原因码要有层级而不是扁平枚举</h3><p>原因码不只是标签，它是 <a href=\"../../exception-governance/exception-trend-rootcause\">差异趋势与根因分析</a> 的核心输入。扁平枚举（<code>channel_error</code>, <code>our_error</code>, ...）粒度太粗，无法支撑&quot;哪个渠道在哪类业务上出错多&quot;这种分析。建立两级结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>一级原因</th>\n<th>二级原因</th>\n<th>责任方</th>\n<th>是否可回收</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手续费差异</td>\n<td>费率版本不同步</td>\n<td>渠道</td>\n<td>是（补差）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手续费差异</td>\n<td>阶梯计费口径不同</td>\n<td>双方约定</td>\n<td>否（内部吸收）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率差异</td>\n<td>换汇点差</td>\n<td>渠道</td>\n<td>否（成本）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率差异</td>\n<td>折算时点不同</td>\n<td>口径</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短款</td>\n<td>渠道漏结算</td>\n<td>渠道</td>\n<td>是（追偿）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短款</td>\n<td>我方漏记账</td>\n<td>我方</td>\n<td>否（内部修正）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长款</td>\n<td>渠道重复入账</td>\n<td>渠道</td>\n<td>是（退回）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长款</td>\n<td>退款未落地</td>\n<td>我方</td>\n<td>否（补记）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未明</td>\n<td>超期无法查明</td>\n<td>不明</td>\n<td>视金额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;是否可回收&quot;这一列直接决定了核销会不会同时生成一条应收记录。把它写进原因码的定义而不是在代码里判断，才能保证规则一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核销日志必须与调查日志同构\">核销日志必须与调查日志同构</h3><p>自动核销与人工核销写入同一张表，只有 <code>decided_by</code> 的类型不同（系统 vs 员工）。这一点在 <a href=\"../exception-classify-match/exception-rule-threshold\">例外规则与容差阈值</a> 里已经提到过，这里强调它的另一面：<strong>只有同构，才能用同一套查询做审计与趋势分析</strong>。如果自动核销写在另一张表里，趋势看板必然要写两个查询再合并，而合并逻辑会随时间漂移，最终两个口径对不上。</p>\n<p>审计轨迹的基本要求是记录谁在何时对哪个对象做了什么，并且能够重建事件（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audit_trail\">Audit trail</a>）。核销记录必须包含：决策 ID、审批人列表与时间、原因码、金额、引用的证据 ID、以及命中的规则 ID（自动核销时）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"已核销差异的重开\">已核销差异的重开</h2><p>核销不是终点。三种情况需要重开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>渠道事后回函推翻了结论</strong>（最常见的重开原因，可能发生在核销后数周）</li>\n<li><strong>内控抽检发现理由不成立</strong></li>\n<li><strong>同一根因的差异批量出现</strong>，说明原核销结论只处理了表象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>重开在数据上不是&quot;把状态改回 pending&quot;，而是<strong>新建一条反向决策</strong>，把已核销的金额重新挂回：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;decision_id&quot;: &quot;WO-2026-09-000612&quot;,&#10;  &quot;reopens_decision_id&quot;: &quot;WO-2026-08-000118&quot;,&#10;  &quot;case_id&quot;: &quot;CS-2026-08-002907&quot;,&#10;  &quot;amount_minor&quot;: 184000,&#10;  &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;,&#10;  &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;channel_reply_refutes_conclusion&quot;,&#10;  &quot;reversal_posting&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;account_code&quot;: &quot;1241&quot;,&#10;    &quot;dr_cr&quot;: &quot;D&quot;,&#10;    &quot;amount_minor&quot;: 184000,&#10;    &quot;narrative&quot;: &quot;重开：渠道回函与原核销结论冲突，恢复挂账&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;requested_by&quot;: &quot;u_7f3a91c2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;approved_by&quot;: [&quot;u_2b8c44e1&quot;, &quot;u_9d1f77a3&quot;],&#10;  &quot;reopened_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T09:14:02Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decision_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WO-2026-09-000612\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reopens_decision_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WO-2026-08-000118\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"case_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CS-2026-08-002907\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"amount_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">184000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"channel_reply_refutes_conclusion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reversal_posting\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"account_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1241\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dr_cr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"D\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"amount_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">184000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"narrative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"重开：渠道回函与原核销结论冲突，恢复挂账\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"requested_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u_7f3a91c2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"approved_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u_2b8c44e1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u_9d1f77a3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reopened_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T09:14:02Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>重开必须重走审批矩阵（金额按原额，不按净额），且必须留痕到<strong>原决策</strong>上——否则无法统计&quot;哪类原因码的核销最容易被推翻&quot;，而这个统计正是容差是否需要收紧的最强信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>核销权限按金额分档，复核成本与犯错成本不对称是分档的核销依据；建单人不得审批自己的决策，用唯一约束与外键函数强制。</li>\n<li>审批矩阵在创建决策时算定并冻结 <code>required_approvals</code>，不在审批过程中重算，否则矩阵变更会让进行中的决策不可解释。</li>\n<li><code>UNIQUE (decision_id, approver_id)</code> 与 <code>comment</code> 最小长度是两条廉价但必要的约束。</li>\n<li>原因码用两级结构，并显式标注&quot;责任方&quot;与&quot;是否可回收&quot;——后者决定核销是否同时生成应收。</li>\n<li>自动与人工核销同构写库；重开是新建反向决策 + 恢复挂账分录，并回链到原决策，用于统计易被推翻的原因码。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核销之后，未清的挂账需要被持续清收——见 <a href=\"aging-exception-cleanup\">账龄分析与积压清理</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"核销审批与权限","id":"核销审批与权限"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：核销是权力，权力要分档","id":"核心概念-核销是权力-权力要分档"},{"level":2,"text":"审批矩阵的数据化","id":"审批矩阵的数据化"},{"level":3,"text":"矩阵的维度与形态","id":"矩阵的维度与形态"},{"level":3,"text":"权限模型","id":"权限模型"},{"level":3,"text":"职责分离的强制检查","id":"职责分离的强制检查"},{"level":2,"text":"核销原因码的治理","id":"核销原因码的治理"},{"level":3,"text":"原因码要有层级而不是扁平枚举","id":"原因码要有层级而不是扁平枚举"},{"level":3,"text":"核销日志必须与调查日志同构","id":"核销日志必须与调查日志同构"},{"level":2,"text":"已核销差异的重开","id":"已核销差异的重开"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"挂账分录与过渡账户","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/suspense-writeoff/suspense-account-posting"},"next":{"title":"账龄分析与积压清理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/suspense-writeoff/aging-exception-cleanup"}}